# Git Remote

- **Repository**: `https://github.com/infotcjeff-ui/cloudbuslink-dev.git`
- This is the canonical remote for this project. All `git push` / `git pull` operations should target this remote unless the user explicitly specifies otherwise.
- Default branch on the remote is `main` unless the user states otherwise.
- When the user says "push" without specifying a branch, push the current branch to its upstream on this remote.
